+# Approver roles & responsibilities (M‑of‑N)
+
+Purpose
+- Define approver roles for the M‑of‑N service, their responsibilities, and rotation/retirement procedures.
+
+Roles
+- Security Approver
+  - Responsible for KMS/HSM operations, key rotation approvals, and emergency key procedures.
+  - Required for KMS alias swaps (M-of-N threshold: 2 of [Security, Infra]).
+
+- Infra Approver
+  - Responsible for deployments, canary promotions in staging/production, and Flagger configuration changes.
+  - Required for production promotions (M-of-N threshold: 2 of [Infra, Product]).
+
